"Under <strong>Repeated timings</strong> the dots spread out. Record the mean \\(\\bar T\\), the standard deviation \\(s\\) and the standard error \\(s/\\sqrt{n}\\) from Analysis. Export and Clear.",
"Press <strong>Hand timing, {#} swings</strong> (N = {#}). Press <strong>Repeat {#} times</strong>. Record \\(\\bar T\\), \\(s\\) and \\(s/\\sqrt{n}\\) of the period T = t/N. Export and Clear.",
